          "snippet": {
            "line": 86,
            "text": "theorem fall_certificate (hD : D.Admissible)\n    (h : IsTrajectory D u v a b) (h0 : v a ∈ D.Safe) (c : ℝ) (cs : List ℝ)\n    (hsegs : FallSegs D.Vhi (D.dnSegs (c :: cs)))\n    (hmin : ∀ x ∈ c :: cs, 0 ≤ x)\n    {s e : ℝ} (hs : a ≤ s) (he : e ≤ b) (hu : ∀ t ∈ Ico s e, D.VIH ≤ u t) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc s e, s + fallTime D.Vhi (D.dnSegs (c :: cs)) ≤ t →\n      v t ≤ finalLevel D.Vhi (D.dnSegs (c :: cs)) := by"
          },
          "declaration": {
            "id": "VoltageToBit.IsTrajectory.fall_certificate",
            "kind": "theorem"
